_WmDU>Working with Arduino Uno</span></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-2 menu__list-item"><a class=menu__link tabindex=0 href=/1.83inch_Touch_LCD_Module/Resources-And-Documents><span class=linkLabel_WmDU>Resources</span></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-2 menu__list-item"><a class=menu__link tabindex=0 href=/1.83inch_Touch_LCD_Module/FAQ><span class=linkLabel_WmDU>FAQ</span></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-2 menu__list-item"><a class=menu__link tabindex=0 href=/1.83inch_Touch_LCD_Module/Technical-Support><span class=linkLabel_WmDU>Support</span></a></ul></ul></nav><button type=button title="Collapse sidebar" aria-label="Collapse sidebar" class=collapseSidebarButton_JQG6><svg class=collapseSidebarButtonIcon_Iseg width=13 height=13 viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill=none aria-hidden=true><path d="M6.5 3L3 7l3.5 4M11 3L7.5 7l3.5 4" stroke=currentColor stroke-width=1.5 stroke-linecap=round stroke-linejoin=round /></svg></button></div></div></aside><main class=docMainContainer_TBSr><div class="container padding-top--md padding-bottom--lg"><div class=row><div class="col docItemCol_VOVn"><div class=docItemContainer_Djhp><article><nav class="theme-doc-breadcrumbs breadcrumbsContainer_Z_bl" aria-label=Breadcrumbs><ul class=breadcrumbs><li class=breadcrumbs__item><a aria-label="Home page" class=breadcrumbs__link href=/><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class=breadcrumbHomeIcon_YNFT><path d="M10 19v-5h4v5c0 .55.45 1 1 1h3c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-7h1.7c.46 0 .68-.57.33-.87L12.67 3.6c-.38-.34-.96-.34-1.34 0l-8.36 7.53c-.34.3-.13.87.33.87H5v7c0 .55.45 1 1 1h3c.55 0 1-.45 1-1z" fill=currentColor /></svg></a><li class="breadcrumbs__item breadcrumbs__item--active"><span class=breadcrumbs__link>1.83inch Touch LCD Module</span></ul></nav><div class="tocCollapsible_ETCw theme-doc-toc-mobile tocMobile_ITEo"><button type=button class="clean-btn tocCollapsibleButton_TO0P">On this page</button></div><div class=mobileCopyPageButton_e2i6></div><div class="theme-doc-markdown markdown"><header><h1>1.83inch Touch LCD Module</h1></header>
<div style=max-width:500px><p><a href=https://www.waveshare.com/1.83inch-touch-lcd-module.htm target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><img decoding=async loading=lazy alt=1.83inch_Touch_LCD_Module src=/assets/images/1.83-product1-d49a2b05c3b54cac109c92083226a9c7.webp width=727 height=652 class=img_ev3q /></a></div>
<p>The <a href=https://www.waveshare.com/1.83inch-touch-lcd-module.htm target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">1.83inch Touch LCD Module</a> is a 1.83inch IPS color touch screen module. It features a high-definition resolution of 240×284 pixels, supports 262K true-to-life colors, delivering clear, detailed images and excellent visual performance. Equipped with a high-transmittance capacitive touch panel, it offers responsive touch feedback and long operational life. The module integrates the ST7789P display driver IC and the CST816D capacitive touch IC, communicating via SPI and I2C interfaces respectively, which minimizes pin usage and simplifies hardware integration. An onboard level shifter ensures compatibility with both 3.3V and 5V power inputs, allowing seamless connection to mainstream controller platforms such as Raspberry Pi, ESP32, Pico, Arduino, and STM32.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>SKU<th>Product<tbody><tr><td>33985<td>1.83inch Touch LCD Module</table>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id=specifications>Specifications<a href=#specifications class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Specifications" title="Direct link to Specifications" translate=no>​</a></h2>
<table><thead><tr><th style=text-align:center>Parameter<th style=text-align:center>Specification<tbody><tr><td style=text-align:center>Operating Voltage<td style=text-align:center>3.3V / 5V<tr><td style=text-align:center>Resolution<td style=text-align:center>240 × 284 pixels<tr><td style=text-align:center>Display Driver<td style=text-align:center>ST7789P<tr><td style=text-align:center>Touch Chip<td style=text-align:center>CST816D<tr><td style=text-align:center>Display Interface<td style=text-align:center>4-wire SPI<tr><td style=text-align:center>Touch Interface<td style=text-align:center>I2C<tr><td style=text-align:center>Display Panel<td style=text-align:center>IPS<tr><td style=text-align:center>Touch Type<td style=text-align:center>Capacitive<tr><td style=text-align:center>Display Size<td style=text-align:center>29.52 × 34.93 (mm)<tr><td style=text-align:center>Pixel Size<td style=text-align:center>0.126 × 0.126 (mm)<tr><td style=text-align:center>Product Size<td style=text-align:center>35.00 × 42.00 (mm)</table>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id=interface-description>Interface Description<a href=#interface-description class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Interface Description" title="Direct link to Interface Description" translate=no>​</a></h2>
<div style=max-width:800px> <img decoding=async loading=lazy alt=" 1.83inch_Touch_LCD_Module Interface Description" src=/assets/images/1.83-product2-edc2ece660b1e88144ad23158bdd43ae.webp width=1029 height=747 class=img_ev3q /></div>
<table><thead><tr><th style=text-align:center>Function Pin<th style=text-align:center>Description<th style=text-align:center>12PIN Number<th style=text-align:center>18PIN Number<tbody><tr><td style=text-align:center>VCC<td style=text-align:center>Power positive (3.3V / 5V input)<td style=text-align:center>1<td style=text-align:center>1<tr><td style=text-align:center>GND<td style=text-align:center>Power ground<td style=text-align:center>2<td style=text-align:center>3<tr><td style=text-align:center>MOSI<td style=text-align:center>SPI data pin (Master Out Slave In)<td style=text-align:center>3<td style=text-align:center>5<tr><td style=text-align:center>SCLK<td style=text-align:center>SPI clock pin<td style=text-align:center>4<td style=text-align:center>4<tr><td style=text-align:center>LCD_CS<td style=text-align:center>LCD chip select, active low<td style=text-align:center>5<td style=text-align:center>9<tr><td style=text-align:center>LCD_DC<td style=text-align:center>LCD data/command control, low for command, high for data<td style=text-align:center>6<td style=text-align:center>7<tr><td style=text-align:center>LCD_RST<td style=text-align:center>LCD reset, active low<td style=text-align:center>7<td style=text-align:center>8<tr><td style=text-align:center>LCD_BL<td style=text-align:center>LCD backlight control<td style=text-align:center>8<td style=text-align:center>2<tr><td style=text-align:center>TP_SDA<td style=text-align:center>Touch panel I2C data pin<td style=text-align:center>9<td style=text-align:center>14<tr><td style=text-align:center>TP_SCL<td style=text-align:center>Touch panel I2C clock pin<td style=text-align:center>10<td style=text-align:center>13<tr><td style=text-align:center>TP_RST<td style=text-align:center>Touch panel reset, active low<td style=text-align:center>11<td style=text-align:center>12<tr><td style=text-align:center>TP_INT<td style=text-align:center>Touch panel interrupt output<td style=text-align:center>12<td style=text-align:center>15</table>
